# Task Closure Checklist

- [ ] Applicable instructions were reread for every affected path.
- [ ] Work stayed within the active request and task scope.
- [ ] Acceptance criteria are mapped to observable results.
- [ ] The read-only harness check passed.
- [ ] Relevant project test, lint, build, and domain checks ran.
- [ ] Negative behavior and policy boundaries were tested where affected.
- [ ] Evidence records include exact revision/fingerprint and limitations.
- [ ] Review findings are resolved, accepted, or explicitly outstanding.
- [ ] External effects and skipped checks are disclosed.
- [ ] Current state and resumption pointers are compact and current.
- [ ] No secret values or unnecessary personal data entered records.

Checking an item records a claim; attach evidence before relying on it.
